      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Illinois Route 41 cuts through Prairie City as East Main Street, heading northeast toward St. Augustine and southwest toward Bushnell.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
